        "original_id": "129a26ed-a3df-5eb3-bbcd-a36f29be0e79",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael A. Cremo, Richard L. Thompson\n- Products: Forbidden Archeology: The Hidden History of the Human Race\n- Organizations: Bhaktivedanta Institute, ISKCON\n- Concepts: Vedic creationism, alternative archaeology\n\nFacts:\n- Michael A. Cremo was born on July 15, 1948.\n- Michael A. Cremo is also known by his devotional name Drutakarmā dāsa.\n- Michael A. Cremo is an American freelance researcher who identifies himself as a Vedic creationist and an alternative archaeologist.\n- Michael A. Cremo argues that humans have lived on Earth for millions of years.\n- In 1993, Michael A. Cremo and Richard L. Thompson published Forbidden Archeology: The Hidden History of the Human Race.\n- Forbidden Archeology: The Hidden History of the Human Race was written in association with the Bhaktivedanta Institute of ISKCON.",
